  "label": "Anti-Black Stereotype: Comparing Black People to Primates",
  "description": "A well-documented and harmful racial stereotype that dehumanizes Black individuals by equating them with apes or monkeys. This stereotype has historical roots in slavery and colonialism and is used to demean, mock, and justify discrimination against Black people. The meme relies on this stereotype to imply that calling someone 'ugly' could lead to them being perceived as a gorilla, thereby mocking and degrading Black individuals.",
